{"parse": {"title": "迷思沉淀", "pageid": 100533, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"headnote-box\"><div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center;\">\n<div style=\"margin-right:1.5em;\"><img alt=\"Disambig orange.svg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Disambig_orange.svg/25px-Disambig_orange.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"19\" class=\"no-select\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Disambig_orange.svg/38px-Disambig_orange.svg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/Disambig_orange.svg/50px-Disambig_orange.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"220\" data-file-height=\"168\" /></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1; min-width:0; font-weight:600; line-height:1.2em\" class=\"serif\">该物品已于<a href=\"/wiki/3.6%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC\" title=\"3.6版本\">3.6版本</a>被<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"2/28\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A5%9E%E6%80%9D%E6%AF%8D%E6%9C%AC\" title=\"神思母本\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A5%9E%E6%80%9D%E6%AF%8D%E6%9C%AC\" title=\"神思母本\"><img alt=\"神思母本\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/CurrencyItem-228.png/100px-CurrencyItem-228.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/CurrencyItem-228.png/150px-CurrencyItem-228.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/CurrencyItem-228.png/200px-CurrencyItem-228.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A5%9E%E6%80%9D%E6%AF%8D%E6%9C%AC\" title=\"神思母本\">神思母本</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">一页荧光闪烁的袖珍纪录，真实且不朽。可用于在脑波编录商店中兑换。</span></span></span>替代。原「迷思沉淀」所有数被等比例替换为「神思母本」。</div>\n</div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"迷思沉淀\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2f/OldItem-228.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"迷思沉淀\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>迷思沉淀</b><img alt=\"OldItem-228.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/OldItem-228.png/24px-OldItem-228.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/OldItem-228.png/36px-OldItem-228.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/OldItem-228.png/48px-OldItem-228.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>28</div></div><hr /><div>自迷思海中凝结而成的晶体固化物。可用于在回声港湾商店中兑换。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">“在拥有意识的遗迹群落中时常能捡到那些漂亮的小石子，它们反射的日光甚至可以照亮回声屿的深处”。知道真相的人会告诉你，这个传闻并不虚假。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "包含顶注的页面", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "已被替代的物品"}], "displaytitle": "迷思沉淀"}}